;; Seed Genome model configuration (component).
;;
;; :planner is the seed model slot; it declares the :reasoning/high
;; alias, which Resolution (component, evoclj.compiler.resolution)
;; resolves against the host-provided provider catalog to the concrete
;; :fixture / "fixture-model-v1" entry. The seed's executable graph has
;; no :llm node in v0 (the runtime registry does not implement it), but
;; the slot stays declared for the later milestones that wire real
;; model providers.
{:models {:planner {:alias :reasoning/high}}}
